#: imageeffect_colorfx.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the effect type to apply on image."
"<p><b>Solarize</b>: simulate a solarization of photograph."
"<p><b>Vivid</b>: simulate the Velvia negative film colors."
"<p><b>Neon</b>: sub-coloring the edges in a photograph to reproduce a neon "
"highlight."
"<p><b>Find Edges</b>: detects the edges in a photograph and their strength."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_colorfx.cpp:174
msgid "Level:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_colorfx.cpp:177
msgid "<p>Set here the level of the effect."
